  message: "Premise re-check 2026-10-25 on dev 16534a75f7 (production-CLI repros on tiny fixtures unless marked code read). CURRENT; the 2026-10-25 docstring audit (6b74ccd833, 7b46c1fe37) touched none of these. Still stale, current refs: ddg_mixed 'walk ran and did not confirm' at taint.py:610-614, :921-925, verify_claims.py:1612-1614, spec :127 (contradicts spec §1603; VERIFY-CLAIMS-SCOPE.md is already right, WI-dopat 4f36dc948e); evidence-row 'the walk refuted' verify_claims.py:5754-5759; unavailable 'the walk ran' dataflow_scope.py:70-71; precise docstring taint.py:5717-5721 (set only on walk confirmed, :6212-6215); envelope comment 'for every finding' verify_claims.py:396-399 (refuted flows are diverted before findings, taint.py:6270-6297); deferred-only docs :1563/:1569-1570 vs code :6441-6449 -- correction: evidence_count = deferred_flows (>= 1), not 1; CONFIRMING_VERDICTS comment :433-435 vs CLI literals cli.py:7957-7981/:8055-8063; exit-3 rationale cli.py:8034-8037, :7959-7964 (16 caveat kinds now, most not repo-supplied inputs); zone lists cli.py:7096-7097, taint.py:327-328 (the filed taint.py:319 and :321-322 are one spot); 'every built-in sink comes from io_primitives' cli.py:7105-7107, taint.py:1935-1937, verify_claims.py:4549-4552 (false since ADR-0060); 'there is no bash catalogue' io_boundary_types.py:440-442, plus unlisted analogue verify_claims.py:3631. The bakeoff-deep == 'confirmed' code bug is split out to WI-fomif so a docs PR cannot close it. Related: WI-dopat (origin of the ddg_mixed half), WI-nomuh (same deferred-only block, different defect). Coordinate with WI-bujum: its rename rewrites several of these sentences. P3 kept."  # b8c7
